<!--
    The ground the mark sits on. A flat colour on purpose: an adaptive icon is cropped to a
    shape the launcher chooses, and any detail near the edge is the detail most likely to be
    cut off.

    Dark blue, so the white pages of the book are what the eye lands on — but lifted far
    enough from black that the ink outline of the book still reads against it.
-->
